{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1416492-do-specializations-apply-to-initiative","id":1416492,"title":"Do Specializations apply to Initiative?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-02T10:20:37-07:00","id":1416492,"title":"Do Specializations apply to Initiative?","content":"For example Dodge, Fast Draw or Fast Reflexes for Athletics, or Hyperfocus or Danger Sense for Integrity.<br /> <br /> Theoretical Specializations such as specific types of denizens for Occult could also be applied.<br /> <br /> Or even an otherwise kind of useless Specialization in specific weapons for Close Combat or Firearms can suddenly come to life and actually serve some purpose.<br /> <br /> I don't see why they wouldn't and it can make initiative rolls more interesting I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9849,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","user":"Aristarkos","date":". 10-02-2020, 01:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T11:10:13-07:00","id":1416498,"title":"","content":"No, specialization don\u2019t affect initiative. Failing in initiative also don\u2019t grant any momentum.<br /> <br /> The reason is simple, Initiative roll is not an action, not even a reflexive action, it\u2019s a roll to define the order the characters will take their actions, not more than that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T12:07:03-07:00","id":1416503,"title":"","content":"Even if you decided they did... I'm not sure what it would really do to make things more interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T23:10:46-07:00","id":1416579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1416492-do-specializations-apply-to-initiative?p=1416503#post1416503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even if you decided they did... I'm not sure what it would really do to make things more interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Partly because it encourages the players to narrate the initiative roll so that they can justify their specializations in it, giving a little more life and roleplay to an otherwise kind of mechanical and dry roll","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-02T23:15:46-07:00","id":1416582,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1416492-do-specializations-apply-to-initiative?p=1416503#post1416503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even if you decided they did... I'm not sure what it would really do to make things more interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It could provide a kind of narrative follow-up. The scion of Hermes, so used to reacting first, and being the quickest, is out-manouvered by the harpy. The momentum gained could certainly be seen as the scion reaching down, pressing further, giving it their all to regain their edge. The momentum gained would be a kind of narrative representation of the hero doubling down. It's what heroes do; they rise. It's expected of them.<br /> <br /> Edit: Thought I'd add that there's no use of initiative specialisations in my game, and nobody's thought to ask. I just thought I'd speculate as to what kind of interest it would add as I like to look at things from the narrative sense, given that I tend to think of gods as (and scions as slowly on their way to) being less 'people' and more 'living concepts that exist inside a narrative'. Play on <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2608,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","user":"Squee","date":". 10-03-2020, 02:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","name":"Squee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-03T02:02:21-07:00","id":1416598,"title":"","content":"I think the issue is that you don't need to add narrative for Specialties to apply. They either do or don't. It's not like Stunts in Exalted where clever narration can get you some extra boosts.<br /> <br /> If my character has an Athletics Specialty in &quot;Fast Reflexes,&quot; and it's agreed that it applies to Initiative rolls, there's no reason for me to bog down the Initiative process narrating how my Close Combat + Cunning benefits from my Fast Reflexes every time we roll it. It doesn't change it from being a +1e each time. It would, at least to me, quickly lose its luster if it's just &quot;everyone narrate their Specialty for +1e,&quot; every time even if some of those narrations are really cool; most of them aren't going to be.<br /> <br /> Since you're always rolling your best combat Skill + Cunning, the odds of out-right failing for the Specialty Momentum is going to be fairly rare as well. Even non-combat focused PCs are easily going to be at 4-5 dice, which means they're below a 25% failure rate for something they roll once per fight. So this isn't going to come up enough to really spur on narration and RP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-03T05:23:05-07:00","id":1416615,"title":"","content":"Well, It could be worth if the players didn\u2019t share the \u201cfocus spot\u201d and any player can use any or the players spot every round.<br /> <br /> But still, it\u2019s not an action to be narrated, it\u2019s just a randomization of the order, just to make the antagonists and PCs act in a certain order.<br /> <br /> You can play with no initiative roll at all, just shuffling players and antagonists turns to make everything work smooth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}